ype=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life isn't just about battling against the evil forces of LADY DEBELLIA. Explore DAYLIGHT CITY and see the wonder it has to offer in its townsfolk and environment. Grab food to eat, buy something for yourself, or help out people with things they should honestly do by themselves, but won't!</p>", "short_description": "D-BEAT HEROES is a grid-based tag-team action RPG! Choose powerful abilities to take with you into combat and fight against your enemies on the grid! Protect Daylight City from the forces of evil and maintain order. Do it before it's too late!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531890/0a0f6a486aa25494be28f5dd5332db65c73c2573/header.jpg?t=1784656450", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531890/a06748a85d62a0fe61429dae0749d419e545b4e7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784656450", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531890/a06748a85d62a0fe61429dae0749d419e545b4e7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784656450", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10 / 8 / 7 / Vista / XP<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.4 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["jqtran.dev"], "publishers": ["jqtran.dev"], "demos": [{"appid": 4412360, "description": ""}, {"appid": 4412360, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 55, "description": "DualShock